%=SNX 2.02 SDL 00:000:00000 ILR 00:000:00000 00:000:00000 P 00000 0 X
*-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
* Eccentricities of the stations that tracked LAGEOS on 2025-01-06, generated by
* tools/fetch-slr-data.sh.
*
* The offset is from the Ranging System Reference Point -- the survey monument the
* terrestrial reference frame solves for -- to the invariant point of the telescope,
* which is what the range is measured from. ITRF2020 and SLRF2020 both quote the
* monument, so a station whose telescope does not stand on it needs this added.
*
* Source: the ILRS Site and System Information Forms, section 3, 'Eccentricity to
* SRP (if Not Identical With SRP)', matched on the CDP system and occupation numbers
* each station wrote in its own CRD h2 record that day:
*   https://ilrs.gsfc.nasa.gov/network/stations/active/<CODE>_sitelog.html
* The ILRS's own databases (ecc_une.snx, ecc_xyz.snx) hold the same numbers but are
* published only through NASA CDDIS, which requires an Earthdata login and so cannot
* be scripted; the site logs are the login-free primary source.
*
* DATA START is the system's Date Installed; the value is the most recent Date
* Measured for that system and occupation, given on the line after it.
*
* These pads left the eccentricity fields blank, which is the statement that their
* monument and their telescope are the same point. They are absent below rather than
* written as zeros, so a station this file has nothing to say about stays visible:
*   1890 BADL, 7237 CHAL, 7249 BEIL, 7819 KUN2, 7821 SHA2
*   7838 SISL, 7840 HERL, 7941 MATM, 8834 WETL
*-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
+SITE/ECCENTRICITY
*                                             UP______ NORTH___ EAST____
*CODE PT SBIN T _DATA START_ __DATA_END__ AXE ARP->BENCHMARK(M)_________
 7090  A   13 L 92:203:00000 00:000:00000 UNE   3.1827  -0.0064   0.0194
*    YARL, MOBLAS-5, CDP system 05 occupation 13, measured 2014-03-21
 7119  A    2 L 11:089:00000 00:000:00000 UNE   2.6300   0.0030   0.0030
*    HA4T, TLRS-4, CDP system 14 occupation 02, measured 2013-05-15
 7124  A    2 L 97:213:00000 00:000:00000 UNE   3.1430  -0.0150   0.0110
*    THTL, MOBLAS-8, CDP system 08 occupation 02, measured 1999-12-15
-SITE/ECCENTRICITY
%ENDSNX
